{
  "id": 1296,
  "name": "relaxed-mint",
  "fling_power": 10,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "nature-mints",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/50/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　かおりを　かがせると\nぼうぎょが　あがりやすく　なるが\nすばやさは　あがりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 향기를 맡게 하면\n방어가 오르기 쉬워지지만\n스피드가 오르기 어려워지는 민트.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓寶可夢聞這種薄荷的氣味，\n會令防禦變得容易提高，\n但速度則難以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si un Pokémon hume cet aromate, sa Défense\nmontera plus facilement, mais sa Vitesse\nse développera plus lentement.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lässt man ein Pokémon an dieser Minze schnuppern,\nsteigt seine Verteidigung schneller, aber seine Initiative\numso langsamer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, aumenta\ncon más facilidad su Defensa, en detrimento de su\nVelocidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quando un Pokémon ne sente il profumo, la sua Difesa\naumenta più facilmente a scapito della Velocità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Pokémon smells this mint, its Defense will grow\nmore easily, but its Speed will grow more slowly.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　香りを　かがせると\n防御が　上がりやすく　なるが\n素早さは　上がりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝可梦闻了这种薄荷之后，\n会令防御容易提高，\n而速度则难以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, aumenta\ncon más facilidad su Defensa, en detrimento de su\nVelocidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
